\fB\-\:config\fR \fIFILE\fR
T}	T{
Configuration file. Default \fB/\:etc/\:xproxy/\:xproxy.\:yaml\fR (\fB/\:usr/\:local/\:etc/\:xproxy/\:xproxy.\:yaml\fR on macOS).
T}
